dn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRVnlPMQ7t4sQn6xv3yQJ_wNckuG-G9SaIv6Px919PC-g&oe=6B09C869"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SVR Player", "keywords": ["video", "player", "360", "180", "cinema"], "long_description": "SVR Player (Simple VR Player) \u2014 everything you need to watch 3D and VR videos on your headset.\n\nA simple, fast, and powerful video player for Meta Quest. Open a file and watch: no accounts, no ads, free to use.\n\nVIDEO FORMATS\n\u2022 Flat 2D, 3D SBS (Half/Full) and 3D OU (Half/Full)\n\u2022 180\u00b0 & 360\u00b0 VR: 2D, 3D SBS, 3D OU\n\u2022 EAC (YouTube 360) 2D & 3D OU\n\u2022 Fisheye 180\u00b0/190\u00b0/200\u00b0/220\u00b0 3D SBS\n\u2022 Instant format switching & auto-detection\n\nCODECS & SUBTITLES\n\u2022 MKV, MP4, AVI, MOV, WebM; H.264 (including 10-bit), HEVC & more\n\u2022 Embedded and external subtitles (SRT, ASS/SSA, VTT)\n\u2022 Multiple audio tracks & external audio files\n\nCOMFORT & SCREEN\n\u2022 Curved or flat screen, adjustable size, distance, height & aspect (16:9, 4:3)\n\u2022 Recenter anytime, speed control, thumbstick seek, resume playback\n\u2022 Built-in file browser with previews & multiple viewing environments\n\nSVR LINK \u2014 STREAM FROM YOUR PC\nWatch videos from your Windows PC over home Wi-Fi without copying files to your headset. Install free SVR Link (elfenlied666.github.io/svr-player), share your folders, and enter the PIN.\n\nPrivacy: no account, no ads, no tracking. Your videos never leave your devices.", "short_description": "SVR Player (Simple VR Player) \u2014 everything you need to watch 3D and VR videos on your headset. Flat 2D/3D, 180\u00b0, 360\u00b0, EAC & Fisheye, subtitles, audio tracks, and Wi-Fi streaming from your PC. Simple, fast, powerful, and free."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://elfenlied666.github.io/svr-player/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "elfenliednyateam", "support_website_url"